OL,3,GNEWSAThe friends who spent #1,000 each
OL,4,Aon a Sinclair C5 - but why?
OL,5,
OL,6,F"A lot of people still say it was ahead
OL,7,Fof its time," cybersecurity engineer
OL,8,FWill Murphy of the Sinclair C5
OL,9,Fbelieves.
OL,11,FInvented in 1985 by British
OL,12,Fentrepreneur Sir Clive Sinclair, the
OL,13,Felectric tricycle did not turn out to
OL,14,Fbe the radical transport solution it
OL,15,Fwas touted as. It failed to sell in
OL,16,Flarge numbers - 14,000 were made and
OL,17,F5,000 were sold.
OL,19,FThere was disappointment with its
OL,20,Flimited range, slow speed and trouble
OL,21,Fgetting up hills.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
