OL,3,GNEWSAThe friends who spent #1,000 each
OL,4,Aon a Sinclair C5 - but why?
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, that has not put off Murphy
OL,7,Fand his best friend Toby Penter, both
OL,8,Ffrom Southampton, who have each
OL,9,Finvested in a Sinclair C5, spending
OL,10,Fmore than #1,000 on original models and
OL,11,Ftheir refurbishment.
